  "photoVisualReview": "15 / 15: machine, implement or installation photo; diagrams not used",
  "notes": [
    "Kubota crop guide includes products from other manufacturers. Maker labels are retained; the five RV attachments are labelled クボタ取扱 because the page does not name the OEM.",
    "MN-103-03 in the guide table conflicts with its body. MN-103-3 is confirmed by the guide body and Matsumoto product page. No MN-103-03 model created; changing stage counts are omitted.",
    "TA page introduction names TA701N-SCJV and TA801N-SCJV; the footnote repeats TA701N-SCJV. TA801N-NY exclusion is retained.",
    "Existing FTN800, TA801N and JB13XN cards are retained and not duplicated.",
    "Unresolved generic boom/tractor-mounted sprayers, radio sprayer and Q-hoe cultivator are not assigned invented models. Guide post650 mixes spraying/scattering terminology and does not reliably map both manufacturers to model names, so no exact product is created from that entry.",
    "Current sales availability, repair instructions and 3D compatibility are not inferred from historical guide listings."
  ]
}
